  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LFT - CDP - ACDI/VOCA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  The purpose of this activity is to build the capacity of locally owned and democratically run businesses through the provision of specialized technical assistance and legal and regulatory reform. The design of this activity was informed by prior program evaluations, sectoral analyses and a co-creation process informed by Mission-based technical specialists, local cooperatives and credit unions, and implementing partners. Funding provided to this IM contributes to delivering on the overall objectives of the global Cooperative Development Program earmark, valued at $18.5 million.</narrative>
  </description>
